  abilityId: 1840438
  abilityName: Bloodied Thunder Claw
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Thunder attack on all foes, 23 combo Thunder attack on single
    foe (damage relative to remaining HP), boosts all elemental damage for 3 turns,
    boosts own Atk, reduces own Def, Rec for 2 turns, fills own BB gauge to max &
    boosts own spark damage for 3 turns
